Intro Bm 7 Em 7 Bm 7 Em 7

{comment: Verse 1 & 2}
Bm 7 Dsus D
Open up our eyes, Lord, we want to see You.
Open the gates, Lord, reveal Your glory.
[A]Open our hearts, Lord, we want to [G]know You.
Open the nations, establish Your kingdom.
Bm 7 Dsus D
Open our ears, Lord, we need to hear You.
Open up the heavens, pour out Your Spirit.
[A]Jesus be revealed, [G]Jesus be rev[D]ealed.

{comment: Chorus}
D Am 7 Bm 7 D
God is here, God is here. God is here, He is able.
D/F# G Bm 7 A
We draw near to see Jesus face to face.
D Am 7 Bm 7 D
God is here, God is here. God is here, He is faithful.
D/F# Bm 7 CM 7 D
We draw near to see Jesus. Oh, Jesus be revealed.

{comment: Interlude}
N.C.
Oh, – oh. –

{comment: Bridge}
Em 7
Holy, we cry holy. Hallelujah, God is here.

{comment: Outro}
{ci: Same as Intro; end on Bm 7}
